{"abstract":"Observations over the past decade show huge ice loss associated with speeding up of glaciers in southeast Greenland in 2003, followed by a deceleration in 2006. These short-term episodic dynamic perturbations have a major impact on the mass balance at decadal scale. However, to improve the projection of future sea level rise, a long-term data record that reveals the mass balance between episodic events is required. Here, we extend the observational record of marginal thinning of Helheim glacier (HG) and Kangerdlugssuaq glacier (KG) from 7 to 30 years. Our measurements reveal that, although the frontal portion of HG thinned by more than 100 m during 2003–2006, it thickened by more than 50 m during 1981–1997. During the same periods, KG was stable until 1998 and experienced major thinning only after 2003. Analyses of their sensitivity to sea surface temperature (SST) anomalies and variations in air temperature suggest that both outlet glaciers respond immediately to small ﬂuctuations in both the SST and air temperature. Furthermore, we compare our observations of ice ﬂow speed and elevation changes with predictions based on the The Parallel Ice Sheet Model (PISM) software.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Khan, Shfaqat Abbas","Fitzner, Antje","Kjær, Kurt","Korsgaard, Niels","Aschwander, Andy","Bjørn, Anders","Bevan, Suzanne","Kjeldsen, Kristian","Bueler, Edward","Luckman, Adrian","van den Broeke, Michiel"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-344204"],"event":{"end":"2013-04-12","place":"Vienna, at","start":"2013-04-07","title":"European Geosciences Union General Assembly 2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Swansea University","University of Alaska Fairbanks","Utrecht University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"long term mass balance of the helheim and kangerdlugssuaq glaciers in","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/54452913/EGU2013-8581-1.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-344204","ids":["dtu-84b5e3fb-0144-4164-a90a-2881142c7634"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D18B210A2BB146AD1706BFE7AD448CAF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/54452913/EGU2013-8581-1.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute, Geodesy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"university of alaska fairbanks","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Alaska Fairbanks","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"gb","key":"swansea university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Swansea University","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"nl","key":"utrecht university","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Utrecht University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Shfaqat Abbas","key":"khanpau","last":"Khan","locid":"a1da0a4e-dc92-4c96-9365-0877275c16c6","name":"Khan, Shfaqat Abbas","orcid":"0000-0002-2689-8563","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Antje","key":"fitznerpau","last":"Fitzner","name":"Fitzner, Antje","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Kurt","key":"kjærpau","last":"Kjær","name":"Kjær, Kurt","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels","key":"korsgaardpau","last":"Korsgaard","name":"Korsgaard, Niels","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Andy","key":"aschwanderpau","last":"Aschwander","name":"Aschwander, Andy","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"bjørnpau","last":"Bjørn","name":"Bjørn, Anders","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Suzanne","key":"bevanpau","last":"Bevan","name":"Bevan, Suzanne","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristian","key":"kjeldsenpau","last":"Kjeldsen","name":"Kjeldsen, Kristian","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Edward","key":"buelerpau","last":"Bueler","name":"Bueler, Edward","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Adrian","key":"luckmanpau","last":"Luckman","name":"Luckman, Adrian","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Michiel","key":"vandenbroekepau","last":"van den Broeke","name":"van den Broeke, Michiel","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["10297006","16077962"],"issn_org":["16077962"],"journal":"Geophysical Research Abstracts","publisher":"Copernicus GmbH","status":"p","title":"Geophysical Research Abstracts"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-84b5e3fb-0144-4164-a90a-2881142c7634"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Long term mass balance of the Helheim and Kangerdlugssuaq glaciers in","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-344204","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"The primary objective of this report is to describe the detection of adenocarcinoma in situ (AIS) and associated human papillomavirus (HPV) type distribution that was observed in the context of two phase 3 clinical trials of a quadrivalent HPV6/11/16/18 vaccine. In this intention-to-treat analysis, we include all women who had at least one follow-up visit postenrollment. Healthy women (17,622) aged 15-26 with no history of HPV disease and a lifetime number of less than five sex partners (average follow-up of 3.6 years) were randomized (1:1) to receive vaccine or placebo at day 1, months 2, and 6. Women underwent colposcopy and biopsy according to a Papanicolaou triage algorithm. All tissue specimens were tested for 14 HPV types and were adjudicated by a pathology panel. During the trials, 22 women were diagnosed with AIS (six vaccine and 16 placebo). There were 25 AIS lesions in total, with HPV16/18 present in 96% (24 of 25 with 15 of 25 as single infections). Only two of 22 women had concomitant cytology results suggesting glandular abnormality. Colposcopic impressions (25 total) were either negative or indicated squamous lesions only. Of women with AIS, all six in the vaccine cohort and seven of 16 in the placebo cohort were infected at baseline with the same HPV type that was detected in the AIS lesion. Concurrent squamous lesions were detected in 20 of these 22 women. In summary, our findings show that AIS evades colposcopic and cervical cytologic detection. As most AIS lesions were HPV16/18-related, prophylactic HPV vaccination should reduce the incidence of invasive adenocarcinoma.","author_count":22,"contributors":["Ault, Kevin A","Joura, Elmar A","Kjaer, Susanne K","Iversen, Ole-Erik","Wheeler, Cosette M","Perez, Gonzalo","Brown, Peter","Koutsky, Laura A","Garland, Suzanne M","Olsson, Sven-Eric","Tang, Grace W K","Ferris, Daron G","Paavonen, Jorma","Steben, Marc","Bosch, F Xavier","Majewski, Slawomir","Muñoz, Nubia","Sings, Heather L","Harkins, Kathy","Rutkowski, Mary Anne","Haupt, Richard M","Garner, Elizabeth I O"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-537245"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corpau":["FUTURE I and II Study Group"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"adenocarcinoma in situ and associated human papillomavirus type distribution observed in two clinical trials of a quadrivalent human papillomavirus vaccine","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ijc.25723","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-537245","identifier":[{"id":"79551497662","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-f104593e-df41-4214-834b-432bd6619d98"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-39D710F7ACFABC98F1A97929EC5F0AB1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ijc.25723","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, BSc + MSc programme"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU"},{"affno":2,"key":"future i and ii study group","name":"FUTURE I and II Study Group","role":"oau"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Kevin A","key":"aultpau","last":"Ault","name":"Ault, Kevin A","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Elmar A","key":"jourapau","last":"Joura","name":"Joura, Elmar A","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Susanne K","key":"kjaerpau","last":"Kjaer","name":"Kjaer, Susanne K","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","